OL,3,AVillagers to vote on 'leaving UK' over 
OL,4,Aplans to house migrants at RAF base    
OL,6,FVillagers will head to the polls on    
OL,7,FSaturday to decide whether or not to   
OL,8,Fsymbolically leave the UK over plans to
OL,9,Fhouse migrants at a former military    
OL,10,Fbase.                                  
OL,12,FRAF Barnham, between Bury St Edmunds,  
OL,13,FSuffolk, and Thetford, Norfolk, has    
OL,14,Fbeen earmarked by the government as a  
OL,15,Fpotential base for up to 931 migrants. 
OL,17,FThe proposals have not gone down well  
OL,18,Fwith locals and far-right groups alike,
OL,19,Fsparking several anti-asylum           
OL,20,Fdemonstrations since the summer.       
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
