OL,3,AVillagers to vote on 'leaving UK' over 
OL,4,Aplans to house migrants at RAF base    
OL,6,FOne way or another, residents are now  
OL,7,Fpoised to make their voices heard by   
OL,8,Ftaking part in a referendum to decide  
OL,9,Fwhether to symbolically secede from the
OL,10,Fcountry or remain.                     
